# Check out text files with LF on every platform. The tests compare generated files against
# fixtures byte for byte, and a CRLF checkout on a Windows runner (git's default there) used to
# break them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures that carry CRLF on purpose, to test readers against Windows line endings.
test/fixtures/codex/home/.codex/AGENTS.md -text

# Binary fixtures.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
